{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01DNWRhBhA3TZSyEjNybwHvY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DK94oH692cY8adk57ZZNoo","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/round0.rs crates/cuda-backend/src/pkey.rs && git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nperf: pre-compute Round 0 logup rules at keygen time + parallelize Phase 2 IDFT\n\nMove static DAG construction, rule compilation, rule encoding, and H2D\ntransfers for Round 0 logup interactions from per-AIR proving time to\nkeygen time (AirDataGpu::new). At proving time, only runtime-dependent\nweight computation remains.\n\nAlso parallelize Phase 2 (D2H + transpose + IDFT) using rayon par_iter,\nsplitting sequential D2H transfers from CPU-bound IDFT processing.\n\nNote: this optimization did not produce measurable improvement (~0ms\nchange at APC 300), likely because GPU kernel time dominates and CPU\nsetup was already fully pipelined with GPU execution.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Commit implementation changes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":741,"cache_read_input_tokens":116745,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":741},"output_tokens":69,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6dad4735-cfc3-4e75-88af-7885288c829c","uuid":"a3854480-0b7b-490b-87a9-ae016ee2b9d8"}
